<title>SWITZERLAND: Danzas reports higher 1996 net, dividend.</title>
<headline>Danzas reports higher 1996 net, dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			13		  vs 6</p>
<p> Div (regd, Sfr)		20		  vs 11.25</p>
<p> Div (certificate, Sfr)     4		   vs 2.25</p>
<p> Net turnover		   4,053	     vs n/a</p>
<p> Gross turnoverr		6,133	     vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - full name is Danzas AG. Main activity is freight forwarding and logistics. Company will report detailed results on May 5, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
